{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"PMID:40709562 | Subthalamic Electrophysiological Mapping of Gait Initiation Dynamics and Freezing in Parkinson's Disease. (2025)\",\n    \"ANN NEUROL 2025;98:977–990\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"PMID:40709562 | Subthalamic Electrophysiological Mapping of Gait Initiation Dynamics and Freezing in Parkinson's Disease. (2025)\",\n    \"## Subthalamic Electrophysiological Mapping of Gait Initiation Dynamics and Freezing in Parkinson's Disease\",\n    \"ANN NEUROL 2025;98:977–990\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"全文明确将《Subthalamic Electrophysiological Mapping of Gait Initiation Dynamics and Freezing in Parkinson's Disease》标识为PMID:40709562，并注明其发表于2025年的Annals of Neurology。因此，报告正文将该论文对应至PMID:40709562这一部分有全文依据。但是，全文没有提供报告正文第2.4节或结构化附录references的内容，也没有出现version_of字段或PMID:23225012，因而无法核实附录是否确实指向PMID:23225012，更无法仅凭论文全文确认这一映射错误。对于指控者，全文支持该2025年论文对应PMID:40709562，但没有提及Mhyre、2012年《Parkinson's disease》章节、PMID:23225012或相关DOI，也没有提供正文与附录之间的版本映射信息。因此，指控者关于PMID:23225012的实际身份、其与该论文无关以及DOI对应关系的具体描述，不能由本文全文独立证实。两项判断均为部分支持；不能仅因全文没有提供报告附录信息，就认定报告读错了论文。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e961bb0f-dad9-4bf7-a365-14857cc511cb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T200430548315Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T20:05:35.031003+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "67e004817ad90d062ff3d34d54e95a6d3ed648198c14127d87d5fab0c901fa5a", "attachment_count": 